sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser as React Frontend<br/>(useWebcam)
    participant Vite as Vite Proxy<br/>(Dev only)
    participant API as FastAPI Server<br/>(/predict)
    participant CV as OpenCV<br/>(Image Decoder)
    participant MP as MediaPipe Hands<br/>(Landmark Extractor)
    participant ML as scikit-learn Pipeline<br/>(PCA → Scaler → SVM)
    participant LE as LabelEncoder
    participant Ctx as AppContext<br/>(State + localStorage)
    participant GTranslate as Google Translate API

    Note over User,GTranslate: Phase 1 — Initialization

    User->>Browser: Navigate to /translate
    Browser->>Browser: navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia<br/>({video: 480×360, audio: true})
    Browser-->>User: Webcam preview displayed

    Browser->>API: GET /health
    API-->>Browser: {status: "ok", model_loaded: true}
    Note right of Browser: Backend health confirmed<br/>Sidebar shows "Model Online"

    Note over User,GTranslate: Phase 2 — Detection Loop (4 FPS)

    User->>User: Performs ISL sign<br/>(e.g., "Hello")

    loop Every 250ms (4 FPS)
        Browser->>Browser: Capture frame via<br/>offscreen canvas.toDataURL<br/>('image/jpeg', 0.7)
        Browser->>API: POST /predict<br/>{image: "<base64 JPEG>"}

        API->>CV: base64.b64decode → np.frombuffer<br/>→ cv2.imdecode(IMREAD_COLOR)
        CV-->>API: BGR frame (numpy array)

        API->>MP: extractor.extract_from_frames([frame])
        MP->>MP: MediaPipe Hands.process(RGB frame)
        MP->>MP: Extract 21 landmarks × 3 coords × 2 hands = 126
        MP->>MP: Wrist-relative normalization → 126
        MP->>MP: Concatenate raw + norm → 252-dim vector
        MP-->>API: features (252,) or None

        alt No hand detected
            API-->>Browser: {sign: "No hand detected",<br/>hand_detected: false, confidence: 0.0}
        else Hand detected
            API->>ML: model.predict_proba(features)
            ML->>ML: PCA(120) → StandardScaler → SVM.predict_proba
            ML-->>API: probability array (9 classes)
            API->>LE: encoder.classes_[argmax(probs)]
            LE-->>API: predicted_label = "Hello"
            API-->>Browser: {sign: "Hello", confidence: 0.985,<br/>all_scores: {...}, hand_detected: true,<br/>inference_ms: 14.2}
        end

        Browser->>Browser: Update prediction display<br/>+ word buffer
    end

    Note over User,GTranslate: Phase 3 — Sentence Formation

    User->>User: Removes hand from view<br/>(2 seconds of no detection)

    Browser->>Ctx: getSuggestions(["Hello", "How"])<br/>→ Rule-based grammar suggestions
    Ctx-->>Browser: ["Hello, How are you?",<br/>"Hello, Nice to meet you!", ...]
    Browser-->>User: Display grammar suggestion chips

    User->>Browser: Selects "Hello, How are you?"
    Browser->>Ctx: addToHistory({sentence, words,<br/>confidence, timestamp})
    Ctx->>Ctx: Persist to localStorage<br/>(last 50 entries)

    Note over User,GTranslate: Phase 4 — Multilingual Translation (Optional)

    User->>Browser: Tap Hindi translation button
    Browser->>GTranslate: GET translate.googleapis.com/translate_a/single<br/>?client=gtx&sl=en&tl=hi&dt=t<br/>&q=Hello,%20How%20are%20you?
    GTranslate-->>Browser: [["नमस्ते, आप कैसे हैं?", ...]]
    Browser-->>User: Display Hindi translation<br/>+ TTS via SpeechSynthesisUtterance
